# Title: Potential Persistence Via Microsoft Office Add-In
# ID: 8e1cb247-6cf6-42fa-b440-3f27d57e9936
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: NVISO
# Date: 2020-05-11
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1137.006
# Description: Detects potential persistence activity via startup add-ins that load when Microsoft Office starts (.wll/.xll are simply .dll fit for Word or Excel).
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((filemod_name:*\\Microsoft\\Addins\\* AND (filemod_name:*.xlam OR filemod_name:*.xla OR filemod_name:*.ppam)) OR (filemod_name:*\\Microsoft\\Word\\Startup\\* AND filemod_name:*.wll) OR (filemod_name:*Microsoft\\Excel\\XLSTART\\* AND filemod_name:*.xlam) OR (filemod_name:*\\Microsoft\\Excel\\Startup\\* AND filemod_name:*.xll))
